loom scan=shell_dialect_touch mode=staged files_read=4 staged_gated_sites=0
file tools/fixtures/s/shell_dialect_touch_scan.sh the commit-time reading -- lifts every pattern and ceiling from the elder, reads staged blobs off the index, gates the five zero-ceiling families
file tools/fixtures/s/shell_dialect_touch_control.sh 28 behaviors on real git repositories in a throwaway pen, every refusal planted then lifted, the hook itself driven
file tools/s/shell_dialect_touch_witness.rish the witness, tier lap
file tools/hooks/pre-commit rule seven, and the header's SIX RULES corrected to SEVEN with the new rule's trigger and reach named
file tools/fixtures/s/shell_dialect_scan.sh the elder's header names its commit-time sibling and says the patterns are lifted rather than respelled
file construction/standing-equipment.kyri the roster row, tier declared -- the undeclared ratchet stands at its ceiling, so a new guard must name its clock
file construction/REDS.md row %609 booked and CLOSED
file construction/ITINERARY.md the Patchouli block rewritten, Git nib carried
scope tools/hooks/pre-commit rule seven, the dialect touch scan and its pen, the elder's pointer, one REDS row
status GREEN -- shell_dialect_touch 28 of 28 pen cases with the wall driven, shell_dialect elder green with all four new files tracked, tame_style_check and ascii_comment green, four touched files graded 82 to 87 with no molt frame. stash_record stays red and stays another seat's.
recommend keep-going -- the four families still ADVISORY in the elder are the next honest reach, and the anchor stays Keaton's word.
